    !---------------------------------------------
    !> \brief  BLAS Level 1 API
    !>
    !> \details
    !> The rotStridedBatched functions apply the Givens rotation matrix defined by ``c=cos(alpha)``
    !> and ``s=sin(alpha)`` to strided batched vectors ``x_i`` and ``y_i``, for ``i`` = 1, ...,
    !> ``batchCount``.
    !> Scalars ``c`` and ``s`` can be stored in either host or device memory. The location is
    !> specified by calling ``hipblasSetPointerMode``.
