    !>
    !> where ``alpha`` is a scalar, ``x`` and ``y`` are vectors, and ``A`` is an
    !> ``m`` by ``n`` matrix.
    !>
    !> - Supported precisions in rocBLAS : ``s``, ``d``, ``c``, and ``z``.
