    !---------------------------------------------
    !> \brief  BLAS Level 2 API
    !>
    !> \details
    !> The hemv functions perform one of the matrix-vector operations:
    !>
    !> y := alpha*A*x + beta*y
    !>
    !> where ``alpha`` and ``beta`` are scalars, ``x`` and ``y`` are ``n`` -element vectors, and
    !> ``A`` is an
    !> ``n`` by ``n`` Hermitian matrix.
    !>
