    !> for quick return.
    !>
    !> @param[in]
    !> ldc    [int]
    !> ldc specifies the first dimension of C. ldc >= max( 1, n ).
    !> @param[in]
    !> batchCount [int]
    !> number of instances in the batch.
    function hipblasCherkBatched_raw(handle, uplo, transA, n, k, alpha, AP, lda, beta, CP, ldc, &
